 authenticity="Nuremberg Diary (Farrar, Straus, 1947) is built from notes Gilbert says he wrote immediately after each conversation, but it was edited for publication and the defendants never checked it; some defence lawyers and later historians have questioned its fairness. The London edition (1948) omits one Göring remark. Digested only.",
